    <string name="legal_license_heading">4. Free Software License (GPL-3.0)</string>
    <string name="legal_privacy_content">100% Privacy &amp; Zero Tracking:\n• No GPS: Absolutely no access to GPS or device location. Locations are selected purely through manual city search.\n• No personal data: This app does not collect, process, store, or transmit any identifying characteristics, device IDs, or advertising IDs.\n• No trackers or SDKs: Neither Google Analytics, Firebase, nor advertising networks are integrated.\n• Local storage: Configured preferences (favorites, location, units, auto-refresh interval) remain strictly local within private SharedPreferences on your device.\n• Direct API connection: Weather queries are fetched directly via encrypted HTTPS from api.open-meteo.com without intermediate relay servers.\n• Data subject rights: Users have rights of access, rectification, and erasure under Arts. 15–21 GDPR. Uninstalling the app or clearing its app storage completely removes all local data.</string>
